use commerce
# Bills and charges that cannot be computed: a second field
# for a bill, an input named by a document, a charge that says something
# twice, a fixed amount with a rounding mode or in another currency, charges
# computed on charges they cannot be computed on, and a document that is not
# the bill's.
contract Bills
parties we, customer

thing Sale
  invoice list HKD at most 5
  receipt list HKD

charge Service
  rate 10%
  added
  per document

charge Fee
  amount USD 2
  added
  per line half up

charge Vat
  rate 6%
  rate 7%
  added
  according to price, Later
  according to Service

charge Line
  rate 1%
  added
  according to Service

charge Inside
  rate 5%
  included
  according to price, Service

charge Fixed
  amount HKD 3
  added
  according to price

charge Other
  rate 2%
  added
  according to receipt
  from 2027-01-01 on rate 3%
  from 2027-01-01 on rate 4%

charge Later
  rate 1%
  added

can bill by we with invoice list HKD
